# (1.4.0, the user's) the Arrangement page's channel strips: a part's white key held (white 1-6: the chord, the pings,
# the bass, the kick, the hats (with the rim and the clap), the noise, as the meters' rows), the knobs that part's
# Level, Echo send, Plate send and Filter (format 28, KellyOffski's: the Low cut before, centred now: right a high-pass, left
# a low-pass); let go, back to the page, no mute; a tap still mutes (on its release); the sends and Filters kept by the
# piece, saved; a 1.4.0 layers' pages project (format 22) read, the strips from the
# recipes; a 1.4.0 strips project (format 23, the drums one strip) read, the kick keeping the drums' Low cut
listen
wait 2000
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
# white 1 held: the chord's strip
key w0 down
wait 700
expect view 26
said Chord strip page
shot strip_chord.png
spin K2 10
wait 300
expect par140 60
said Echo 60
shot strip_chord_echo.png
spin K4 30
wait 300
expect par148 28
said Filter HP 290
spin K4 -40
wait 300
said Filter Off
expect par148 0
spin K4 -12
wait 300
said Filter LP
expect par148 <0
spin K4 40
wait 300
expect par148 0
spin K4 30
wait 300
expect par148 28
spin K1 -2
wait 300
expect par0 50
key w0 up
wait 300
expect view 17
expect mutes 0
# a tap: a mute, as before (the levels kept)
tapkey w0
wait 300
expect mutes 1
expect view 17
tapkey w0
wait 300
expect mutes 0
# a knob turned at once, the key just down: the strip at once (the pings')
key w1 down
spin K3 -20
wait 300
expect view 26
expect par143 30
key w1 up
wait 300
expect view 17
expect mutes 0
# white 4 held: the kick's strip (its own level, x1 at 50; its sends none, as before); white 5: the hats' (the Hats
# page's Level; the drums' sends, the rim's and the clap's in them); white 6: the noise's (its sends the Noise space
# page's were)
key w3 down
wait 700
expect view 26
said Kick strip page: Level 50, Echo 0, Plate 0, Filter Off
spin K2 20
wait 300
expect par154 20
said Echo 20
spin K1 -5
wait 300
expect par153 45
spin K1 5
wait 300
key w3 up
wait 200
key w4 down
wait 700
said Hats strip page: Level 40, Echo 50, Plate 50, Filter Off
spin K2 20
wait 300
expect par146 70
expect par154 20
spin K1 5
wait 300
expect par114 45
shot strip_hats.png
spin K1 -5
wait 300
key w4 up
wait 200
key w5 down
wait 700
said Noise strip page
spin K3 -10
wait 300
expect par122 40
shot strip_noise.png
key w5 up
wait 300
expect view 17
expect mutes 0
# (the kick's strip seen, its Echo turned up, for the manual)
key w3 down
wait 700
shot strip_kick.png
spin K2 -20
wait 300
expect par154 0
key w3 up
wait 300
expect mutes 0
# the bass's echo: none in a piece (0); turned up, heard
key w2 down
wait 400
expect par144 0
spin K2 30
wait 300
expect par144 30
key w2 up
wait 3000
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# kept by a save (GLO held), and read again
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect par140 60
expect par148 28
expect par144 30
# a 1.4.0 layers' pages project (format 22): a piece changed kept (its chord level), the strips from the recipe (50
# and 50, the bass's echo 0, the Low cuts off)
store22
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect par0 50
expect par140 50
expect par148 0
expect par144 0
expect par146 50
# a 1.4.0 channel strips project (format 23: the drums one strip, its Low cut on the kick too): the Hats strip's Low
# cut kept, the kick's the same (as it sounded); its level x1, its sends none
tap SEL
wait 300
key w4 down
wait 700
spin K4 25
wait 300
expect par151 23
key w4 up
wait 300
store23
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect par151 23
expect par156 23
expect par153 50
expect par154 0
